  '124': { name: 'Ponceau 4R', cls: 'Colour — synthetic azo dye', verdict: 'bad', risk: 'high', organs: { brain: 3, immune: 2, cancer: 1 }, harm: 'Southampton-six azo dye linked to child hyperactivity; histamine liberator that worsens asthma and urticaria. Carcinogenicity debate led the USA to ban it.', symptoms: 'Hyperactivity, hives, breathing difficulty in asthmatics', adi: '0.7 mg/kg bw/day (EFSA)', law: 'Banned in USA and Norway; EU warning label mandatory.' },
